  "semantics": {
    "nearest": "SetArea(center,49) overlays search area; reachable unoccupied maximum area weight; ties use minimum remaining score <99, first X outer/Y inner. Not minimum movement cost.",
    "reachability": "SetArea2 start=budget+1, neighbors=budget. SetArea4 stores remaining before subtracting current tile movement cost. Terrain99/-99 blocks; occupied enemy group ID/50 blocks, same group can traverse.",
    "modes": "Parent2 -> GetMovePos mode1 (HP>=floor(maxHP*50/100):MoveAttack, otherwise nearest); parent4 -> mode2 MoveAttack; parent8 -> mode3 nearest. MoveAttack outside search radius falls back to nearest. Combat-directed branches are not substituted.",
    "eligibility": "Soldier AI uses state20 or prepares movement at full AP when not state10/1. Current adapter additionally requires existing ownership/canMove/known budget/native flags.",
    "path": "MoveCharPath requires positive coordinates below200 and uses movement range+7 for path generation. Original recursive backtracker is reused through existing cardinal compressed adapter path, not claimed bit-identical for every original packet.",
    "limits": "Own commander0 members1..9 only. Existing explicit authority approves final units/AP; no default authority, AP cost or charge period; inside defense timer and enemy targeting are separate."
  }
